==Description==
The '''Winter Lights Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 11 of the premium [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|285}} or {{Robux|52}} ({{Robux|41}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|1,540}} or {{Robux|792}} ({{Robux|629}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

The '''Winter Lights Nametag''' has blue to purple gradient text and translucent black outline. Multiple blue crystals and iridescence appear on it. Trails of dark purple flow along the nametag from left to right.

